    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about social causes",
     "texto": [
      "**Folkehelse** refers to the health of the population. **Levekår** are living conditions; **tilgang til** indicates that something is within a person's reach.",
      "**Ikke bare ... men også ...** presents two important factors, without reducing the topic to just one."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
